    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e100d9674b795d085d3720c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我终于明白。西沙里奥\n为何会对别人的关照如此敏感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd7fc897c6fa6be95422b5b4dae20af8d36bf6bd7172b1e9baa57d3517a24885",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        63,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/63/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7d8be7ad411ee75bbd4b5ac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也明白了她为何不愿袒露心声――",
      "source_fingerprint": "003038acbcd4e22e3b5dd982c4e137dc13e80f317bc36131d823e3394c306a2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        64,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/64/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf5c31ee6f8fba49a3200cb4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这就是她几乎不曾把低落的表情，\n展现在我面前的原因吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae0c72549aede0478477067200c8a887206824e03e9bbef1ee39f92c1bb68669",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        65,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0635c35370ecf075fc3cf2af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不……",
      "source_fingerprint": "27cb2d7aa998916f9337f882aa0e5e2b1558cf9803c32b7e9ed03254a30d746f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        66,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/66/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c4718464494ab952d0c6fab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7ea8f429e376dcab41bee5b946ee4fb9dc8e928a406a356926b617ad6aaffb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        66,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/66/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f5e9169affbd7d22acf83d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "让您感到不快了，\n非常抱歉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "baa2dbe3cea769a4e94404f716be2b19be9db21bcc4fd5f7d5f788475e06e878",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        66,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/66/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57f7f921b297afc790d3aeb3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我才该说对不起，真的没能成为你的依靠",
      "source_fingerprint": "763acb8faaef857d14e6757421075a58a6305ec1db851f3a400d05e264c69f87",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        67,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/67/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf7e5f1bc35ba22ba455e703",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽说她感到了责任，但若当时的我\n是足够可靠的训练员，她或许根本\n不会想到要隐瞒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39e1a9f49bf0ca815bcec60ad2241e5d6fb5e0c858c06e0a8af7ae417b88d049",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        67,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/67/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ce02570b262341da8d87524",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从今以后，无论什么都可以跟我说",
      "source_fingerprint": "97875f9b15bf70f4aa62a714ee3c7db03b2d4c8eaca0dfa0a50f14b0eac82580",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        68,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/68/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:484759dc6878ce3592a8d743",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从成为训练员的那一刻起，夸张点说\n我已经把命运交给了西沙里奥。\n我早有觉悟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2943c2d92330487d2cac605dfa982247216a7204e74ddaf56fdc34ad520feee3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        68,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/68/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:850933567ecd893a3da7963f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我咽下直到此刻都没能成为她依靠的悔恨\n把这些话说出来后――",
      "source_fingerprint": "33beeecbfe01cf3ecf57f8f7ef7fc98681f5cf4623cd8ffa51d8506f1778fac2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        69,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/69/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0868aa8be73776a3ddfebbd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "俱乐部的教练",
      "source_fingerprint": "174f470a0d90521fadc9cfea554c24ef2ba8ae5080a1c323d7b669e09e55bd10",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35ac55cbb0f9a918628ae04a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喂喂，给我站住！\n在训练场外不许全力奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2c14bcda5f89542bec1e15c400c1f16b4aa016a4200cc3e7753081f586852ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e2da812b563b08fd90c05f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……诶？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f161f665efce1e5ee1df388903c168da302fe1992cff1b29667536a61e16027e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110114.json",
